Drop the `debug_assert!`s on the payload length.

Upstream checks in debug builds that the payload of `hash` and of the
`*_ema` functions is at most `u32::MAX` bytes long. Neither the
implementation nor the specification needs the bound, and the contracts
state correctness for every length.

